From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gxt43 <72811640+gxt43@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:54:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Mac host: join the default preferences domain at run time,
 for multi-program games

Symptom: the Mac host of LUNAR Remastered Collection (a launcher and two game programs, packed
as one app with the profile key programs) does not compile: front_mac.m and controllers_mac.m
stop in input_preferences_mac.h with "called object type 'NSString *' is not a function or
function pointer".

Cause: input_preferences_mac.h built the fallback preferences domain by joining two literals at
compile time, [@"org.nxnative." DM_GAME_ID lowercaseString]. That works when DM_GAME_ID is a
string literal, as in a one-program game's game_profile.h. For a game of several programs,
game.py header_multi defines it as (dm_game_cur()->id), a C string read at run time, and the
juxtaposition no longer parses.

Fix: join the strings at run time, [[@"org.nxnative." stringByAppendingString:@(DM_GAME_ID)]
lowercaseString], as front_mac.m already boxes DM_GAME_ID with @(...). The domain is the same
string for a one-program game.

Checked: with this change Lunar's Mac app builds and runs the launcher and both game programs
(M3 Max); the domain string of a one-program game is unchanged (the same characters, joined at
run time).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhC6PmqAEWZuUNEEEgBm91

Upstream-Status: pending (a fix to patch 0017's input_preferences_mac.h, forwarded as seedds/nxnative#221: it belongs in that pull request)
Reason: patch 0017's input_preferences_mac.h does not compile for a game of several programs (LUNAR Remastered Collection), where DM_GAME_ID is read at run time
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1224

---
 dm/host/input_preferences_mac.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dm/host/input_preferences_mac.h b/dm/host/input_preferences_mac.h
index b3a2dee..bedb78a 100644
--- a/dm/host/input_preferences_mac.h
+++ b/dm/host/input_preferences_mac.h
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 #include "game_profile.h"
 #include "input_map.h"
 static NSString *input_preferences_domain(void) {
-    return NSBundle.mainBundle.bundleIdentifier ?: [@"org.nxnative." DM_GAME_ID lowercaseString];
+    return NSBundle.mainBundle.bundleIdentifier ?: [[@"org.nxnative." stringByAppendingString:@(DM_GAME_ID)] lowercaseString];
 }
 static BOOL input_preferences_enabled(void) {
     const char *off=getenv("DM_SAVED_CHOICES"); return !off || strcmp(off,"0");
